OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dogs make a difference for
OL,4,Apatients
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudent pharmacy technician Finn
OL,7,FSpillane said: "It's really nice to
OL,8,Fhave a nice little cuddle." Suzette
OL,9,FJansen van Rensburg, from the Critical
OL,10,FCare Unit, said: "Everyone's really
OL,11,Fhappy to see Perla the dog."
